  "summary": "Preinstall fetches Bun runtime and executes obfuscated bundled payload",
  "details": "The package's preinstall script (setup.mjs, wired via scripts.preinstall in package.json) downloads the Bun runtime from GitHub releases into a temp directory and then uses that runtime to execute a sibling file math_init.js. math_init.js is a ~727KB single-line bundle using classic string-array obfuscator output (shuffled numeric/string constant array with a rotator function pushing/shifting the array), and its filename does not correspond to the package's stated purpose (a Docusaurus UI-kit contribution). Executing the payload under a freshly downloaded non-Node runtime evades Node-focused install-time inspection. The scope and name resemble the legitimate ServiceTitan anvil-uikit-contrib project, but the shipped tarball is a dropper that runs at install time rather than UI-kit source.",
